### Cursor

Config file: `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (global) or `.cursor/mcp.json` (project-scoped, recommended)

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "rebalance": {
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "rebalance.mcp_server"],
      "env": {
        "REBALANCE_DB": "/Users/you/path/to/rebalance.db"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

